  {
    "episode_id": 81194,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81194.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Well, she was assigned that task by Joe Biden and many in the media called her the borders are proudly and now they're taking that down. They're, they're refuting their own assertions, taking, you know, trying to scrub their own websites to take that away. But look, the truth is she's done very little. She went to the El Paso sector in 2021. And by the way, I was in the El Paso sector in 2021. That was before it really got busy like it is now. So she really didn't take the time she was talking about You know, the southern three triangle countries that are supposedly part of this, ignoring the fact that there are over 130 different nationalities represented by illegal border crossings. She's never been to the northern border, which is really relevant to all of us. I've been sounding that alarm since I went there back in 2023 last year when I heard that we had huge increases there. Discussions say that we have over 440% increase by that's put out by customs and border protection. We have a lot of issues coming across the northern border. Even Fox News was up there this weekend for a few days watching people literally walk over the Canadian US border. So she's not even talking about any of those things and she was indeed whether you want to call her Zara or not. That was her specific assignment by Joe Biden and I described her as someone who remains uninformed I think almost intentionally and she hasn't put the effort in that she needs to do to solve this problem because I don't think she really has an interest. So she's weak on the immigration issue. She's done nothing about the increasing food and gas prices, the inflation we're all seeing. She hasn't really distinguished the difference between rioting and free speech. She was out there giving money to these protesters who were committing violent crimes, actually committing violence instead of, you know, peaceably protesting, you know, doing pitch videos to help uh... with bail of people who were destroying federal property during the so-called summer of love you know all of this is just proof that she is not ready to serve and another real astonishing thing about it which i think is going to be interesting how she handles it is she was after her meeting uh... with uh... benjamin net yahoo who had met uh... within a store to address an absolutely amazing address uh... under in the u.s. congress laying bare the facts she actually came out And she used statistics from the Gaza Ministry of Health, you know, basically Hamas. She paraded Hamas's claims of genocide, starvation, and the civilian number of casualties. Instead of those things, all had been debunked, by the way. Months earlier, by the UN, imagine that, which is definitely not a right leading organization. And she just continues to parent whatever she needs to parent of the Democrat talking points. And I worry what the Democrats are going to do when they pull the teleprompter away from her, just as their concerns were of taking it away from Joe Biden.",
