    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "I think there has to be. What I think is astounding is the Democrats are actually calling President Trump weak for wanting to change the time of the debate. There's, you can say a lot of things about President Trump. Week is not. This man was nearly assassinated, stood up with blood streaming down his face and yelled a fight and is back on the campaign trail, going to outdoor rallies. Talk about, he is a profile in courage. He is willing to go out and continue to fight for the American people. So I think they ought to change their dialogue on President Trump. Maybe come up with something else. One thing he is not is weak. He is very courageous and strong and everyone knows that. He is faced in overcoming credible adversaries and adversity, I should say, from the Democrats, whether it's taking him down using lawfare, going after his family, everything that's been done to President Trump to try to take him out, you know, without using the ballot box. And they even tried doing that in 2020. And I think they're going to do it again in 2024, honestly.",
