    "turn_text": "You know, you can pick on everything, little thing he says, and that's what the media is going to do because they're not going to go after JD Vance's record. They're not going to go to JD Vance's amazing, you know, rise from poverty, from Appalachia and Ohio to becoming a lawyer, serving in the Marine Corps, becoming a lawyer, being a successful entrepreneur. They're going to pick out every little thing he says because that's all they have. uh... he's a young guy with a you know interesting family and i think that that's going to be i think that you know there's just that that just shows that they have nothing really on him so uh... those things are are we hear them complain about republicans constantly you know they've got those types of uh... you know really insignificant uh... comments if you want to talk about comments let's just run all the stuff that joe biden said starting from what he said about uh... president obama all the way through his years uh... there you know whether it's racist sexist and then look at everything that uh... como harris said i mean they really aren't having they have nothing really to stand up for when it talks about uh... eric comments and look i do have a lot of friends were kat ladies and they're proud that they're proud of it i i love cats too so that does that make me uh... you know a victim of jd vance's uh... ire",
